Clean-Room Provenance Statement
================================================================================

DryMachina is an independent, clean-room implementation authored from
specification and first principles. FullControl (GPLv3,
https://github.com/FullControlXYZ/fullcontrol) is used solely as:
(a) Architectural inspiration for the multi-level dialect design, and
(b) A dev/CI-time behavioural test oracle generating expected outputs for
